{"change_summary":"Audited the pending carbonate amendments against the current worktree, confirmed the bicarbonate-cache/runtime preset-calibration paths are now present, and finished the remaining execution work by aligning the shared pH-bound usage/fixture setup with the explicit carbonate contract. The remaining code delta normalized the substrate/filter integration fixture onto canonical DIC+alkalinity inputs with an immediate carbonate resolve, kept preset-validation expectations on the calibrated interior pH range, and revalidated the acid-crash/high-buffer solver behavior plus the previously failing shrimp/filter regressions under the explicit solver.","outstanding_risks":["Legacy save files that already serialized custom or out-of-range `source_water_catalog` entries are still loaded as-authored; this execution tightened shipped preset validation but did not migrate previously saved source-water chemistry catalogs.","The carbonate guard paths remain aquarium-focused approximations outside the quadratic envelope rather than a full charge-balance model with OH-/borate/other buffers.","The unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory was present in the worktree and was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the pending carbonate amendments against the current codebase to determine which fixes were already landed versus which gaps still required code or fixture changes.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Validate the low-alkalinity acid-crash and high-buffer guard-band solver behavior, and verify the shared pH-bound handling is consistent with the explicit carbonate contract.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Normalize the substrate/filter integration fixture onto calibrated DIC/alkalinity inputs with an immediate carbonate resolve, and keep source-water preset validation/test expectations aligned with the calibrated interior solver range.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Run formatting plus targeted and full regression suites to confirm chemistry, substrate/filter, shrimp, save/load, and preset validation behavior remain green.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all` completed successfully.","`cargo test -p tank_core` passed after formatting.","`cargo test -p tank_data --lib` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test chemistry -- --nocapture` passed (18 tests).","`cargo test -p tank_core --test substrate_filter_integration -- --nocapture` passed (4 tests).","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_population hatch_produces_juveniles -- --exact --nocapture` passed."]}